    'The [[C0]] header may include a directive that indicates caching, like [[C1]] with a [[C2]] higher than [[C3]]. Note that this only suggests that the resource is cacheable. It isn\'t always indicative of caching, as the cache may sometimes override this header.' => 'Header [[C0]] dengan [[C1]] dan [[C2]] di atas [[C3]] menandakan kelayakan cache, meski aturan CDN kadang menimpanya.',
    'If you notice a big difference in response time for the same request, this may also indicate that the faster response is served from the cache.' => 'Respons kedua yang jauh lebih cepat juga kerap menandakan cache hit.',

