    'Exploiting static extension cache rules' => 'Mengeksploitasi aturan cache ekstensi statis',
    'Cache rules often target static resources by matching common file extensions like [[C0]] or [[C1]]. This is the default behavior in most CDNs.' => 'Aturan bawaan banyak CDN menyimpan semua URL yang berakhiran ekstensi statis seperti [[C0]] atau [[C1]].',
