    'You can then craft a URL that returns a dynamic response that is stored in the cache. Note that this attack is limited to the specific endpoint that you tested, as the origin server often has different abstraction rules for different endpoints.' => 'Karena bergantung konfigurasi routing per endpoint, pengujian perlu diulang untuk tiap rute target.',
