    // Delimiters
    'Delimiter discrepancies' => 'Perbedaan delimiter',
    'Delimiters specify boundaries between different elements in URLs. The use of characters and strings as delimiters is generally standardized. For example, [[C0]] is generally used to separate the URL path from the query string. However, as the URI RFC is quite permissive, variations still occur between different frameworks or technologies.' => 'Karakter pemisah (delimiter) membatasi elemen URL seperti [[C0]], namun framework berbeda sering mendukung karakter pemisah tambahan yang berbeda pula.',
    'Discrepancies in how the cache and origin server use characters and strings as delimiters can result in web cache deception vulnerabilities. Consider the example [[C0]]:' => 'Contoh pemakaian delimiter titik koma pada [[C0]]:',
