    'The same is true for other characters that are used inconsistently between frameworks or technologies. Consider these requests to an origin server running the Ruby on Rails framework, which uses [[C0]] as a delimiter to specify the response format:' => 'Ruby on Rails memakai [[C0]] sebagai pemisah format respons:',
    '[[C0]] - This request is processed by the default HTML formatter, which returns the user profile information.' => '[[C0]]: diproses penampil HTML bawaan.',
