    'Some delimiter characters may be processed by the victim\'s browser before it forwards the request to the cache. This means that some delimiters can\'t be used in an exploit. For example, browsers URL-encode characters like [[C0]], [[C1]], [[C2]], and [[C3]], and use [[C4]] to truncate the path.' => 'Waspadai perilaku browser korban yang otomatis meng-encode karakter seperti [[C0]], [[C1]], [[C2]], [[C3]] atau memotong fragmen pada [[C4]].',
